  "id": "ethnocentrism",
  "term": "ethnocentrism",
  "definition": "Consumer ethnocentrism is the belief that buying products made in one’s own country is the right and more morally acceptable choice than buying foreign goods. In this context, it relates to preference for domestic brands and loyalty to products associated with the home country, and may also connect with identity and materialistic motives.",
